invalid type: string "The levels are:\n\n1. Developing\n2. Progressing\n3. Consistent\n4. Strong\n5. Exceptional\n\n## Self Review\n\nEmployees must complete their self-review within 7 calendar days\nafter the review window opens.\n\n## Manager Review\n\nManagers have 10 calendar days after receiving the employee's self-review\nto complete their assessment.\n\n## Calibration\n\nnal Communication\n